  (text "PSU: existing 30 V / 10 A bench supply, no CC/CV. F101 + D101 (TVS) protect against overvoltage and reverse polarity (D101 conducts, F101 blows)."
    (at 25 144.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 5b168e6b-3f28-4b15-89ca-2391ba6896e8))
  (text "J102: 12 V buck module (XL4015 or LM2596HV) for Peltiers, relays and fans.   J103: 5 V buck module (MP1584) for Blue Pill, comparators and BTS7960 logic."
    (at 25 148.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid c4e900be-6ddf-4f83-b41a-3bb53c9ccbf6))
