    (uuid 2f172c59-1a09-4a0c-b268-178b9de3b8d6))
  (text "J104: bimetal thermostat KSD9700, normally closed, 60 C, mounted on the load heatsink. It cuts +12V_SW (relay coils + Peltier driver) independently of firmware."
